# Force-control axes [Mx,My,Mz,Mrx,Mry,Mrz] (= x,y,z,rx,ry,rz). Matches RTPRI setImpedance*.
# Empty array = skip that field (ROS only); else size 6. Cached, resent on start_force_control.

# Inertia > 0. [kg] / [kg m^2].
float64[] impedance_mass

# Stiffness >= 0. [N/m] / [Nm/rad].
float64[] impedance_stiffness

# Damping ratio >= 0 (1 = critical). Send with mass/stiffness if changing both.
float64[] impedance_damping_ratio

# Compliance >= 0; non-zero axes enter force selection.
float64[] compliance

---
bool success
string message
